<title>JAPAN: JGBs end firmer on investor buying.</title>
<headline>JGBs end firmer on investor buying.</headline>
<text>
<p>*Key June JGB futures end higher as investor buying detected in cash JGBs, but capped by heavy offers at 125.70.</p>
<p>*Life insurers buying cash JGBs at long end of yield curve while selling intermediate sector.</p>
<p>*Some public fund bodies also seen buying at long end.</p>
</text>
